  "prefLabel": "Ins 6202.01 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 6202.01 Applicability and Scope. Ins 6202 shall apply to all individual and group ancillary health policies and certificates that provide coverage for hospital confinement fixed indemnity and other fixed indemnity as applicable and which are not covered under other rules and are delivered or issued for delivery in this state on and after the initial effective date of this part.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Ins 6200) #12659, eff 11-5-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins6200.html"
